            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.10.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ebr 10:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jamulembe acel kud ucung kum dhanu kum kier moko, kadi kum dubo moko, i dubo moko m’edubo: ku dhu jumulembe ario, kadi ku dhu jumulembe adek, lembe bicungo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tek jamulembe ma pwe ngo ai malu kum ng’atu moko kara etuc wie mi timo rac, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "dhanu ario, ma dhau ni i kindgi, bilund cungo i wang’ Yehova, i wang’ julam ku jupoklembe ma gibedo nuti i ceng’ maeca; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "e jupoklembene bikoro i lembe cu: man, nen, tek jamulembene bedo jamulembe mi ndra, man etuco lem ndra kum umin; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wulund wutim i kume, calu ie paru ebitimo bang’ umin: kab dubo woko kud i kindi kumeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E ju m’udong’ gibiwinjo, man lworo binegogi, e ugambre i nindo maeca gibitimo dubo ma kumeca kendo ngo i kindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
